      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aufenthalt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visits" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aufenthalte (Visits)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While using" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beim Verwenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without Always, the app only records while it is open. You can change this at any time in the iOS Settings under Location." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ohne Immer erfasst die App nur, wenn sie geöffnet ist. Du kannst das jederzeit in den iOS-Einstellungen unter Standort ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without location, the app cannot record places. You can allow it in the iOS Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ohne Standort kann die App keine Orte erfassen. Du kannst ihn in den iOS-Einstellungen erlauben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without precise location, iOS shifts your location by a few kilometers. Cities can then be off, and at borders even the country." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ohne genaue Position verschiebt iOS den Standort um einige Kilometer. Städte können dann danebenliegen, an Grenzen auch das Land."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "World map. %@ and %@ visited. The list tab shows them as a list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Weltkarte. %@ und %@ besucht. Der Tab „Liste“ zeigt sie als Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year filter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jahresfilter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your home region is found automatically once the app has recorded a few days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Heimatregion wird automatisch erkannt, sobald die App ein paar Tage erfasst hat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your places stay on your iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Orte bleiben auf deinem iPhone."
